  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump libkrun and rebuild the bundled libraries for all four platforms by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1217\n* Show a pack pull's download progress and report the bytes a broken transfer actually moved by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1218\n* Free a machine's data before the registry write when deleting by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1219\n* Resolve an archive request against the workspace root by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1220\n* Bump the workspace to 1.14.6 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1221\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.14.5...v1.14.6",
